# Reference sha256s of the custom iPXE binaries. iPXE stamps build
# metadata, so these are NOT bit-reproducible — supply-chain integrity
# is enforced by the pinned upstream commit in build/compile-ipxe.sh,
# not by these hashes. Regenerate with build/build.sh.
